     {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": " digest used to run with no verification at all, in silence, and still wrote a receipt carrying the checkpoint's hash — indistinguishable from a verified one. It is now refused: weights silently different from what the receipt names are an irreproducible result that reads as reproducible."
     }
